! HADDOCK ambiguous distance restraints for the 1CLL vs 1zg4 pair.
! Generated as a starting template – adjust residue IDs and tolerances as needed.
! Chain identifiers correspond to the prepared/renamed PDBs (partner 1 → segid A, partner 2 → segid B).

! Ambiguous interface contacts between partner 1 (A) and partner 2 (B)
assign (segid "A" and resid 25 and name CA)
       (segid "B" and resid 40 and name CA) 5.0 2.0 2.0

assign (segid "A" and resid 52 and name CA)
       (segid "B" and resid 64 and name CA) 4.5 2.0 2.0

assign (segid "A" and resid 78 and name CA)
       (segid "B" and resid 118 and name CA) 5.5 2.5 2.5

! Optional loose CM-like restraint to keep partners in proximity
assign (segid "A" and name CA)
       (segid "B" and name CA) 15.0 10.0 10.0 weight 0.1
